  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f1b918fc5de4f448a14402d08e1f332, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryContent
  introductionText:
  - 'Stable port to Qurotema. Vision coming in for RO.

    Visuals on our end are...
    good enough.'
  - 'Stable comms. Gates forcing one-way channel.

    Expected.'
  - 'Data channels active.

    We''ll be studying Qurotema alongside you, Operator.'
  - Initiating vessel control soon.
  - And, Di? Finish Sino's work.
  monolithFirstText:
  - 'Confirming i-tema characters on visual feed.

    This seems familiar. Loading
    local translations to compare.'
  - 'Yes, it''s our only translated entry. Strange coincidence.

    "The night will
    flow when black time''s sand knows foreign touch."'
  - 'Gates should share two of those words, "Quro" and "Tema". "Black time".

    No
    gates visible though.'
  - 'Anyways, this isn''t new information.

    Find more monoliths, we''ll fill
    the database for linguistic analysis.'
  monolithSecondText:
  - Another mon.lith. Uploading t.xt back home.
  - We'll st.rt transl.t.ons once you'.e back.
  instrumentText:
  - 'H.gh activ.ty on sonic dat. chan.els!

    Pi.king up faint s.gnal n.arby. Cont.nue
    expl.ration.'
  - 'M.re aud.o. Mus.c?

    L.st v.sual fe.d, st.ll getting a.l oth.r r.adings.
    Just ke.p .p t.e rese.rch.'
  - 'Th.s .sn''t r..ht.

    Con.ection is bec.m.ng too unst.bl.. I''m begin..ng
    a pull.'
  endText:
  - Co..ection st..ili.y drop..ng f.s.. Di, wh.t's ..ing on?
  - Di! B.dy ......  ..resp.n.ive. ...... ret.r. pro.ocol ...... .....cit.te.
  - No p.ng on Qur..em.. ...... ve..el ...... v...d.
  - ......
  uniqueText:
  - 'Monolith visual confirmed. But there''s no writing on it.

    Is it inactive?'
  - 'Confirming new reading. Incredible! There''s nothing like this in Sino''s docs.

    Keep
    experimenting, maybe we can learn something.'
  - Press escape again to disconnect.
